<title>CHINA: Deutsche Bank launches Hutchison warrants.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank launches Hutchison warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG, London Branch, said  on Friday it launched 80 million American-style call warrants on shares  of Hutchison Whampoa Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$69.525    PREMIUM	 11.7 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$1.677     GEARING	 4.60x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  02.JUN.98    LISTING DATE  25.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    PAYDATE	 21.AUG.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$77.25     MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> SETTLEMENT	  PHYSICAL ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
